3. COMMISSION (PROFIT SHARE)
   If you use the Software, or any derivative of it, to generate trading
   income — meaning trading decisions, entries, exits, or sizing that are
   made by, executed by, or materially informed by the Software — you owe
   Sundar1k a commission of 5% (five percent) of Net Trading Profits.

   "Net Trading Profits" means gross realized trading gains minus the
   direct costs of that trading: broker commissions and fees, exchange
   fees, funding/swap costs, slippage, and data/API fees attributable to
   the trading. It is calculated before personal income tax and before
   any drawdown of unrealized losses.

   Payment is due quarterly, within 30 days of the end of each calendar
   quarter in which any Net Trading Profit was realized. Payment must be
   made in Bitcoin (BTC) to:

     bc1q3xqpc603l80vwcn9dr9d8g7rdevl42mldwvlpn

   You must keep records sufficient to verify the calculation for at
   least three (3) years and provide a written summary of the calculation
   to Sundar1k within 30 days of a reasonable request.

